<title>UK: Next Coal sets final terms on Sfr warrant issue.</title>
<headline>Next Coal sets final terms on Sfr warrant issue.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Next Coal Ltd has set the exercise price for following equity-linked issue, lead manager Banca del Gottardo said.  Joint lead managers are Daiwa Securities Bank (Switzerland) and Sumitomo Bank (Schweiz).</p>
<p> BORROWER   NEXT COAL LTD</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  THE SUMITOMO BANK LTD</p>
<p> AMT  110.35 MLN SFR  COUPON     0.125     MATURITY    20.SEP.99</p>
<p> TYPE	 WARRANTS  ISS PRICE  100.50    PAY DATE    20.SEP.96</p>
<p> PAY FREQ   ANNUAL    EX PRICE 533.00 YEN  PREMIUM     2.50 PCT</p>
<p> NOTES	NOTES WITH WARRANTS TO PURCHASE FULLY PAID AND</p>
<p>		NON-ASSESSABLE SHARES OF COMMON STOCK OF SUMITOMO</p>
<p>		COAL MINING.</p>
<p>		EXERCISE PERIOD - 04.OCT.96-06.SEP.99</p>
<p>		50 WARRANTS PER NOTE</p>
<p>		FOREX RATE 90.62 YEN PER SWISS FRANC</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
